  "paragraphs": [
    "Share transfer and other communication regarding Share Certificates, Dividends, Change of Address etc. may be addressed to the company’s Registrar & Share Transfer Agent.",
    "Name of compliance officer : Mr. Alpesh Gandhi",
    "Address : MUFG Intime India Private Limited, “Geetakunj” 1, Bhakti Nagar Society, Behind ABS Tower, Old Padra Road, Vadodara – 390 015.",
    "Phone No . : (0265) 3566768",
    "E-mail : in vestor.helpdesk@in.mpms.mufg. com",
    "Website : https://in.mpms.mufg.com/",
    "View : Compliance Letter",
    "Name of compliance officer : Mr. Alpesh Gandhi",
    "Address : Link Intime India Private Limited “Geetakunj” 1, Bhakti Nagar Society, Behind ABS Tower, Old Padra Road, Vadodara – 390 015",
    "Phone No . : (0265) 3566768",
    "E-mail : vadodara@linkintime.co.in",
    "View : Compliance Letter",
    "Join us in our journey of unwavering principles and transformative growth. Together, we will continue to write success stories, leaving an indelible mark on the chemical industry and the world at large.",
    "P.O.: Ranoli – 391 350, Vadodara, Gujarat, India Phone: +91 265 6111000 Fax: +91 265 6111012",
    "P.O. Dahej-392 130, Taluka-Vagra, Dist. Bharuch, Gujarat, India. Phone: +91 2641 613200 (Reception) Phone: +91 2641 613256 (Security Reception)"
